  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.6: Per-row and per-cell source positions on tables (#31). `TableRowNode.Source` and `TableCellNode.Source` are now populated by the parser, and the matching `TableRowLayout.Source` / `TableCellLayout.Source` are propagated by `LayoutBuilder`. Live-preview consumers can now map editor scroll position to table rows authoritatively instead of estimating, and hover-to-source / per-cell diagnostics work cell-granular. Multi-line cells (an `a|` cell whose content spans several physical lines) get a source range that covers the full span. See CHANGELOG.md.",
